This package adapts the spec-driven workflow of OpenSpec (https://github.com/Fission-AI/OpenSpec),
version 1.15.0, which is released under the MIT license. The license text is in LICENSE-OpenSpec.

The artifact formats, validation rules, delta merge order and the wording of several skills follow
OpenSpec's schemas/spec-driven and src/core/templates/workflows. Kiln changes them to hand artifacts
between stages with its own tools and to run without the OpenSpec command line. The mapping from each
skill to its upstream source is in engine/internal/workflows/openspec-source.json.
